            <h3 class="rd-step-title">Use Focused or View Render Modes</h3>
            <p class="rd-step-desc">
              In <code>render-style="read"</code>, every single endpoint and schema table is mounted into the DOM at once. For
              specifications with over 100 endpoints, switch to <code>view</code> or <code>focused</code>:
            </p>
            <ul class="rd-step-bullets">
              <li class="rd-step-bullet-item">
                <span class="rd-bullet-tag tag-focused">Focused Mode</span>
                <span>Mounts only the single active endpoint in the DOM. Ideal for 500+ endpoint portals.</span>
              </li>
              <li class="rd-step-bullet-item">
                <span class="rd-bullet-tag tag-view">View Mode</span>
                <span>Groups operations into collapsible accordions, rendering endpoint details on demand.</span>
