            <p class="rd-step-desc">
              Deeply nested polymorphic schemas can cause recursive model unfolding. Cap automatic expansion to level 1 or 2 using <code
                >schema-expand-level="1"</code
              > to preserve DOM efficiency and keep memory flat:
            </p>
            <div class="rd-step-code">
              <CodeBlock code={tuningConfigCode} lang="html" filename="Production Mega-Spec Configuration (HTML)" />
